==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Because of the very low magnification of the [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]], focus on bringing [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie units]]. Spamming attackers to brute force the level is really all you need to do to win.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
The Starred Aliens have low enough magnification that you can skip a few [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from Chapter 3 without much trouble. [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] works quite well for blocking the Zackie Pengs. Li'l Zyclone can be annoying, but Holy Blast can stop him from blocking off your units. Remember to bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] for the UltraBaaBaas.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Clear a path for [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] at the beginning, then use Breakerblast to destroy Le'Solar's [[Barrier]]. This should kill her before Cadaver Bear even spawns. After that, Awakened Bahamut should destroy the base and you win.

